                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;This new release is a service update as part of Uno Platform 7.0 — &lt;a href="https://aka.platform.uno/blog-7-0" rel="nofollow"&gt;read our blog on the previous 7.0 release&lt;/a&gt; for more details.&lt;/p&gt;
