&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please refer to the &lt;a href="https://aka.platform.uno/migrate-from-previous" rel="nofollow"&gt;migration guide&lt;/a&gt; when upgrading to &lt;strong&gt;Uno Platform 7.0&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
